    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/eee878bc6d0a3ae0db1c88a9927f846d.avif?t=1750557181\" data-has-big /></div><strong>A Wonderful, Wicked World Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shyftrs</strong> is a 2D hand-drawn single-player <strong>Metroidvania adventure</strong>, blending dark fantasy with mythic storytelling and stylish visuals. Inspired by legends and cultures across history, it invites players into a vibrant, mysterious world where every step forward uncovers secrets buried in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll take on the role of <strong>Brams</strong>, a young apprentice from the prestigious <strong>House of Corvin</strong>\u2014one of <strong>Esos\u2019</strong> most renowned families of explorers. When your parents vanish during a secret expedition, your search for answers leads you through an unimaginable twist of fate: you\u2019re suddenly transported to <strong>Ikarus</strong>, a strange and beautiful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Brams, you\u2019ll explore the mythical lands of Ikarus and its hidden dimension\u2014the <strong>Astral World</strong>, a surreal bridge between Ikarus and Esos. Along your journey, you\u2019ll unravel the truth of your family\u2019s legacy, uncover your mysterious ancestry, and face creatures and powers that defy reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you return to Esos\u2026 or will Ikarus reshape your destiny forever?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized Hand-Drawn Art</strong><br>Every character, creature, and landscape is meticulously illustrated by hand, creating a world that feels both sketched and alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Interconnected Realms to Explore</strong><br>Traverse the dual dimensions of Ikarus and the Astral World\u2014each packed with secrets, hidden paths, and lore-rich environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Mix &amp; Match Combat System</strong><br>Craft your own combat style by combining skills unlocked through exploration, boss battles, crafting, and side quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Secrets Behind Every Shadow</strong><br>Discover hidden rooms, unlock rare relics, and uncover forgotten truths in a world that rewards exploration and curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc09 <strong>100+ Unique Enemies</strong><br>Face an ever-expanding roster of enemies\u2014from twisted undead to bizarre creatures born from myth and madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Custom Soundtrack &amp; Environmental Design</strong><br>An immersive original score and parallax-painted backdrops bring each biome to life with atmosphere and storytelling depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ASTRAL WORLD EXPLORATION</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Activate a Key Stone to travel back and forth between the Main world and Astral Realm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/a23451dbd8714503aaa92dc6f49c2836.poster.avif?t=1750557181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/a23451dbd8714503aaa92dc6f49c2836.webm?t=1750557181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/a23451dbd8714503aaa92dc6f49c2836.mp4?t=1750557181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6b72e759be05858ac1dba5870c20ce4b.poster.avif?t=1750557181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6b72e759be05858ac1dba5870c20ce4b.webm?t=1750557181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6b72e759be05858ac1dba5870c20ce4b.mp4?t=1750557181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Astral World will have:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tNew Level layout for player to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tNew Enemies and Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tNew Hidden treasures / relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <br><strong>ASTRAL ENEMIES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/378f00d6081024f9b41ad5c9b2d84854.poster.avif?t=1750557181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/378f00d6081024f9b41ad5c9b2d84854.webm?t=1750557181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/1c1a846b2027939a3411b73fa28545a3.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/36c53b2476986b379a69d176f3f887a3.poster.avif?t=1750557181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/36c53b2476986b379a69d176f3f887a3.webm?t=1750557181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/36c53b2476986b379a69d176f3f887a3.mp4?t=1750557181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain new skills and abilities to overcome obstacles and explore deeper. Discover hidden portals to a parallel dimension and choose how you tackle each challenge\u2014your creativity shapes the journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/00fe714bd77c6cecd103e469d05fc2e4.poster.avif?t=1750557181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/00fe714bd77c6cecd103e469d05fc2e4.webm?t=1750557181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/00fe714bd77c6cecd103e469d05fc2e4.mp4?t=1750557181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Kingdom of Adden in Ikarus will serve as the backdrop for the action, a land rich in magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It will include a vast network of interconnected biomes, each with its unique biodiversity of flora and wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/de5297fe8063e4374c6da2ac81131a91.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Visit our website to see major updates about the game and our future plans on the Update / Blog section.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/c9cbeb800b3100fb96e912e8052de2b6.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/f09c553f53f6df49a28d0644f27fbdc2.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6377d006adafd9801baa9b81c2420ede.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div>The team has been working non-stop. Our first objective was to obtain an initial funds to push the development of Shyftrs, and we were successful in receiving funding from CODE NZ last December 2022 and the recent one last August 2024. We are incredibly thankful of the CODE NZ team's assistance in guiding Shyftrs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/377ba5cd5d54cc3634f07421c9f97e8a.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/Discord.png?t=1750557181\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/34862ee104facfa6728c4532e92d0fc0.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/5d753d1616818730e25973a413184709.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/eee878bc6d0a3ae0db1c88a9927f846d.avif?t=1750557181\" data-has-big /></div><strong>A Wonderful, Wicked World Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shyftrs</strong> is a 2D hand-drawn single-player <strong>Metroidvania adventure</strong>, blending dark fantasy with mythic storytelling and stylish visuals. Inspired by legends and cultures across history, it invites players into a vibrant, mysterious world where every step forward uncovers secrets buried in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll take on the role of <strong>Brams</strong>, a young apprentice from the prestigious <strong>House of Corvin</strong>\u2014one of <strong>Esos\u2019</strong> most renowned families of explorers. When your parents vanish during a secret expedition, your search for answers leads you through an unimaginable twist of fate: you\u2019re suddenly transported to <strong>Ikarus</strong>, a strange and beautiful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Brams, you\u2019ll explore the mythical lands of Ikarus and its hidden dimension\u2014the <strong>Astral World</strong>, a surreal bridge between Ikarus and Esos. Along your journey, you\u2019ll unravel the truth of your family\u2019s legacy, uncover your mysterious ancestry, and face creatures and powers that defy reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you return to Esos\u2026 or will Ikarus reshape your destiny forever?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized Hand-Drawn Art</strong><br>Every character, creature, and landscape is meticulously illustrated by hand, creating a world that feels both sketched and alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Interconnected Realms to Explore</strong><br>Traverse the dual dimensions of Ikarus and the Astral World\u2014each packed with secrets, hidden paths, and lore-rich environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Mix &amp; Match Combat System</strong><br>Craft your own combat style by combining skills unlocked through exploration, boss battles, crafting, and side quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Secrets Behind Every Shadow</strong><br>Discover hidden rooms, unlock rare relics, and uncover forgotten truths in a world that rewards exploration and curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc09 <strong>100+ Unique Enemies</strong><br>Face an ever-expanding roster of enemies\u2014from twisted undead to bizarre creatures born from myth and madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Custom Soundtrack &amp; Environmental Design</strong><br>An immersive original score and parallax-painted backdrops bring each biome to life with atmosphere and storytelling depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ASTRAL WORLD EXPLORATION</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Activate a Key Stone to travel back and forth between the Main world and Astral Realm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/a23451dbd8714503aaa92dc6f49c2836.poster.avif?t=1750557181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/a23451dbd8714503aaa92dc6f49c2836.webm?t=1750557181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/a23451dbd8714503aaa92dc6f49c2836.mp4?t=1750557181\" type=\