website to see major updates about the game and our future plans on the Update / Blog section.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/c9cbeb800b3100fb96e912e8052de2b6.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/f09c553f53f6df49a28d0644f27fbdc2.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6377d006adafd9801baa9b81c2420ede.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div>The team has been working non-stop. Our first objective was to obtain an initial funds to push the development of Shyftrs, and we were successful in receiving funding from CODE NZ last December 2022 and the recent one last August 2024. We are incredibly thankful of the CODE NZ team's assistance in guiding Shyftrs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/377ba5cd5d54cc3634f07421c9f97e8a.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/Discord.png?t=1750557181\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/34862ee104facfa6728c4532e92d0fc0.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/5d753d1616818730e25973a413184709.avif?t=1750557181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
